Z||000001||WhiteFieroBlur||10-27-2001||01:04 PM||||yeah I live in a small town in Oklahoma and I am the only one fixing up my fiero. Everyone else who has one looks crappy. There are a few that look nice but they aren't doing anything to em. But I do get so many people saying all kinda of stuff about it. Everyone tells me its so nice but they will tell you its crap in the long run. All I need is a nice paint job and rims and this town will be drolling over fieros all over again. I can swear I felt I was the only fiero in this town when I first got mine and now people want one. Everyone always use to ask me to sell it to them when I first bought it. I wish I had a friend who liked fieros like me in my town  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
